# Test retakes

When Sam reports a GT or VT score **below 80%**, immediately create the retake HTML (do not wait to be asked), unless he explicitly skips it.

- Path: `courses/hsk{L}/{gt|vt}/retakes/` (adjacent to the original test folder)
- Names: `hsk{L}-gt-CL{kk}-r2.html` · `hsk{L}-vt-{NN}-r2.html` (later attempts `-r3`, …)
- Fresh items; do not copy the failed test verbatim. Weight `needs_review` points/words from the score summary.
- Also generate the targeted remediation P (missed grammar) before pointing him at the retake.
- Log the fail first; a later passing retake **replaces** that fail row.
- This CL01 fail (8/11, 2026-11-10) was **skipped** — do not backfill `hsk4-gt-CL01-r2.html`.
